---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice | GeoWork" description="Learn how GeoWork handles information shared through its contact form.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>LEGAL</div><h1>Privacy <span class="accent">notice.</span></h1><p>Last updated October 30, 2026</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container privacy-copy article-body">
  <h2>Information you provide</h2><p>When you contact GeoWork, you may provide your name, email address, company name, website URL, service interests and message. We use these details to respond to your inquiry and discuss potential services.</p>
  <h2>Form processing</h2><p>If this website is hosted on Netlify with form processing enabled, Netlify processes form submissions on our behalf. Contact us by email if you prefer not to use the form. We do not intentionally collect sensitive personal information through the form.</p>
  <h2>Analytics and external services</h2><p>The website may load fonts from Google Fonts and a GitHub-connected content editor for authorized editors. Additional analytics or advertising tools should only be added after this notice has been updated to describe them.</p>
  <h2>Retention and requests</h2><p>We keep business inquiries for as long as reasonably necessary to communicate and manage potential client relationships. To request access, correction or deletion of information you have submitted, email <a href="mailto:contact@geowork.us">contact@geowork.us</a>.</p>
  <h2>Updates</h2><p>We may update this notice when the website's services or data practices change. The latest version will be posted here.</p>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
